{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_131","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/sh -lc \"/tmp/apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: prepare_references.py\n@@\n-        journal = (content.get('metadata', {}).get('container-title') or ['arXiv preprint arXiv:' + identifier if kind == 'arxiv' else 'Working paper'])[0]\n+        journal = 'Journal of Machine Learning Research' if kind == 'jmlr' else (content.get('metadata', {}).get('container-title') or ['arXiv preprint arXiv:' + identifier if kind == 'arxiv' else 'Working paper'])[0]\n*** Update File: paper.tex\n@@\n-Table~\\\\ref{tab:seed} gives every recorded condition. Error values are multiplied by \"'$10''^3$; target accuracy, coverage, and interval width remain on the unit scale. Synthetic targets and diagnostics average four regimes with $1024$ replicates each. A real row has a single audit-reference error and a binary containment indicator, so a value of one is not an estimate of certain population coverage. The machine-readable '\"\\\\texttt{analysis/condition\\\\_results.csv} additionally includes all six comparator errors, signed errors, and recorded diagnostics. \\\\texttt{analysis/summary.json} supplies equal-weight condition and regime means without additional scientific evaluations.\n+Table~\\\\ref{tab:seed} gives every recorded condition. Error values are multiplied by \"'$10''^3$; target accuracy, coverage, and interval width remain on the unit scale. Synthetic targets and diagnostics average four regimes with $1024$ replicates each. A real row has a single audit-reference error and a binary containment indicator, so a value of one is not an estimate of certain population coverage. The machine-readable '\"\\\\texttt{analysis/condition\\\\_results.csv} additionally includes all six comparator errors, signed errors, and recorded diagnostics. \\\\texttt{analysis/regime\\\\_results.csv} preserves the full regime-level metrics and supplied report-MSE standard errors; these marginal standard errors are not used as errors for paired method differences. \\\\texttt{analysis/summary.json} supplies equal-weight condition and regime means without additional scientific evaluations.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\npython prepare_references.py\n/tmp/paper-tools/bin/python complete_reference_consultation.py\npython build_claims.py\ncp task/resources/final/smoke_examples.json source_evidence/resources/smoke_examples.json\ncp -r task/resources/final/paper_template source_evidence/resources/paper_template\n/tmp/paper-tools/bin/python - <<'PY'\nimport pymupdf\npdf=pymupdf.open('paper.pdf')\nfor index in [0,1,4,5,6,7]:\n pdf[index].get_pixmap(matrix=pymupdf.Matrix(1.2,1.2)).save(f'/tmp/paper_page{index+1}.png')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
